WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.333
Alright,

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:10.533
a number series!

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:11.267
Six,

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:12.000
ten,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.733
fourteen,

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:13.467
eighteen,

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:14.933
and then...

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:17.133
what comes next?

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:17.867
A.

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:18.600
Twenty,

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.333
B.

00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:20.067
Twenty-four,

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:20.800
C.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.533
Twenty-six,

00:00:21.533 --> 00:00:23.000
or D.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.733
Twenty-two?

00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:25.200
Five seconds!

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.200
TIME'S UP!

00:00:32.867 --> 00:00:33.467
It's...

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:34.033
D,

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:34.633
twenty-two!

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:38.133
Each number goes up by four:

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:38.733
six,

00:00:38.733 --> 00:00:39.300
ten,

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:39.900
fourteen,

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:40.467
eighteen,

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:44.000
so eighteen plus four is twenty-two.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:45.733
Alright!

00:00:45.733 --> 00:00:48.833
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:49.433
A.

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:50.067
Square,

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:50.667
B.

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:51.300
Triangle,

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:51.900
C.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.533
Circle,

00:00:52.533 --> 00:00:53.767
or D.

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:54.367
Cube?

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:55.600
Five seconds!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.600
TIME'S UP!

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:03.733
It's...

00:01:03.733 --> 00:01:04.167
D,

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:04.633
cube!

00:01:04.633 --> 00:01:05.533
A square,

00:01:05.533 --> 00:01:06.000
triangle,

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.733
and circle are all flat shapes.

00:01:08.733 --> 00:01:11.467
A cube is a solid shape

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:12.833
you can hold,

00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:15.100
so it does not belong.

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:17.333
Here's one,

00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:18.933
a number puzzle,

00:01:18.933 --> 00:01:20.500
and it's sneaky!

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.700
If two plus three makes eleven,

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:26.367
four plus one makes nine,

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:29.000
three plus five makes twenty-three,

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.667
then two plus four makes...

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:32.200
what?

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:32.733
A.

00:01:32.733 --> 00:01:33.267
Twelve,

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:33.767
B.

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:34.300
Sixteen,

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:34.833
C.

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:35.367
Fourteen,

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:36.433
or D.

00:01:36.433 --> 00:01:36.967
Eight?

00:01:36.967 --> 00:01:38.033
Five seconds!

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.000
TIME'S UP!

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:46.967
The answer is...

00:01:46.967 --> 00:01:47.367
C,

00:01:47.367 --> 00:01:47.800
fourteen!

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:49.533
Multiply the two numbers,

00:01:49.533 --> 00:01:51.667
then add them both back:

00:01:51.667 --> 00:01:53.800
two times four is eight,

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.400
plus two plus four is fourteen.

00:01:57.533 --> 00:01:57.933
So,

00:01:57.933 --> 00:01:59.967
are you smart or fart?

00:01:59.967 --> 00:02:02.400
Count up your correct answers to

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.600
find your rank!

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:05.100
So,

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.500
how did you do?

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:07.867
Comment your score below,

00:02:07.867 --> 00:02:09.233
and follow for more!
